{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着移動DRAM合約價格持續上漲、供應緊張，一些手機品牌正考慮把從舊設備拆下的內存晶片重新加工後，裝入新手機，尤其是入門機型。TrendForce估計，這類「重植球」內存2026年在智能手機市場的滲透率約為3%至4%，2027年可能升至7%至9%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585658.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.363936+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T17:27:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"66a332d620715ba2c29473ed3e7b9380d1e0a52bd530101ba23faa9ce9bd74f4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}